            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **Devin sessions were still stuck on "Idle" in 0.5.19.** Everything 0.5.19
  described was built, but the part that switches it on never ran, so Perch
  never actually started listening to Devin. Update and it works — no setup, no
  setting to find. Stats and the usage bars were unaffected and worked in 0.5.19.
]]></description>
